abstract: >-
  Analysis software, derived numerical data, metadata, and figure-production
  materials supporting a study of a tripolar Hall electromagnetic structure
  observed by MMS during strong-guide-field reconnection at Earth's dayside
  magnetopause on 22 January 2016.
